      "items": [
        {
          "field": "description",
          "fieldtype": "jira",
          "from_string": "As a Developer, I want a {{wishlist-login-panel}} content component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, so that it renders the authentication prompt inside the {{pdp/drawer}} (SFCC-736) when a logged-out shopper attempts to add an item to their wishlist.\n\nThe component covers the panel content only — the drawer shell, slide-in behaviour, overlay, and close trigger are owned by {{pdp/drawer}} (SFCC-736). This component renders as children passed into that shell.\n\nThe panel content comprises three sections separated by dividers:\n\n# Email / OTP section — explanatory copy, email input field, and Send Code CTA\n# Social sign-in section — Sign in with Apple and Sign in with Google buttons\n# New account section — New to Zimmermann? heading, supporting copy, and Create an Account CTA\n\nAuthentication logic and API integration are out of scope for this story and are covered in the relevant auth stories.\n\n||Prop|| ||Values|| ||Notes||\n|size|Large, Small, Mobile|Controls layout variant|",
          "to_string": "As a Developer,\n I want a {{wishlist-login-panel}} content component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, \nso that it renders the authentication prompt inside the {{pdp/drawer}} (SFCC-736) when a logged-out shopper attempts to add an item to their wishlist.\n\n----\n\nThe component covers the panel content only — the drawer shell, slide-in behaviour, overlay, and close trigger are owned by {{pdp/drawer}} (SFCC-736). This component renders as children passed into that shell.\n\nThe panel content comprises three sections separated by dividers:\n\n# Email / OTP section — explanatory copy, email input field, and Send Code CTA\n# Social sign-in section — Sign in with Apple and Sign in with Google buttons\n# New account section — New to Zimmermann? heading, supporting copy, and Create an Account CTA\n\nAuthentication logic and API integration are out of scope for this story and are covered in the relevant auth stories.\n\n||Prop|| ||Values||Notes||\n|size|Large, Small, Mobile|Controls layout variant| |"
        }
      ],
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-21T14:51:19.200000+10:00"
